; An invalid --time-round on an option line in the journal is rejected
; where it is read, with the file and line, rather than truncated: 15x
; is not a whole number of minutes.

--time-round 15x

i 2024/01/01 09:00:00 Projects:Work
o 2024/01/01 09:07:00

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 5:
While parsing option '--time-round'
Error: Invalid value for --time-round: 15x; expected a positive number of minutes
end test
